ht through it was discovered the  president Ellis had actually handed over  the antivirals to the black tusk and  that they had been working together and  in fact had something to do with the  death of the last president they hadn't  put into power the antivirals were being  held at the black tusk tidal basin  headquarters the agents launched an  attack and managed to fight through the  technologically superior forces  regaining control of the antivirals  Washington DC is once again in a state  of mayhem with the three original  hostile factions although without their  original leaders fighting for control  and now a new more powerful faction  attempting to establish a new dynasty to  lead the country into a new era  prison else has been located he is found  to be hiding out at the presidential  retreat Camp white oak under heavy guard  by Black task forces the JTF  and the division assault the compound in  an attempt to arrest  Ellis and bring him back for questioning  unfortunately before they could reach  him he managed to escape his whereabouts  are currently unknown the division  agents then turn their attention to the  Pentagon they have received a  transmission from an agent close by the  agent was scouting the DARPA labs to see  if they had succeeded in developing a  perfusion bioreactor with this device  they will be able to produce large  quantities of the broad-spectrum  antivirals and start to distribute them  across the population however they  weren't the only ones looking for it a  large black task operation was underway  they were attempting to dig down through  the Pentagon and extract the bioreactor  but the division agents managed to put a  stop to this and turned killing dozens  of black task officers the perfusion  bioreactor has now been kept at the  White House along with the  broad-spectrum antibiotics tip towards  creating a cure requires the agents to  find someone capable of running such an  undertaking someone with experience in  this fie